ate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"68b3ba3a701bb55e\" href=\"?note=68b3ba3a701bb55e\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing10-semi-generic-condition.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing10-semi-generic-condition.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12SemipropernessWitness}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12SemipropernessWitness}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}semiproperness\\text{-}witness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12SemipropernessWitness}_S(q,p,M,P,\\leq_P,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow p\\in P\\cap M\\land q\\leq_P p\\land\\exists W\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10SemiGenericCondition}_S(q,M,W,\\theta,P,\\leq_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}semiproperness\\text{-}witness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12SemipropernessWitness}_S(q,p,M,P,\\leq_P,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow p\\in P\\cap M\\land q\\leq_P p\\land\\exists W\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10SemiGenericCondition}_S(q,M,W,\\theta,P,\\leq_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\leq_Pp\">\\(q\\leq_Pp\\)</span> is semigeneric for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>: every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>-name that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> forces to be a countable ordinal is forced equal to a check name from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\cap\\omega_1\">\\(M\\cap\\omega_1\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The semigeneric clause is delegated to the canonical six-place predicate, which binds a set ground model and uses exact check-name and forcing-relation predicates.</li>\n<li>This six-argument witness predicate is the existential projection over that ground model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing10-semi-generic-condition.md","status":"resolved","id":"68b3ba3a701bb55e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing10-semi-generic-condition.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing10-semi-generic-condition.md","status":"resolved","id":"68b3ba3a701bb55e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10SemiGenericCondition}_S$ (fully typed semigeneric-condition predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-zfc-forcing10-semi-generic-condition.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"q,p,M,W,P,\\leq_P,\\theta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10SemiGenericCondition}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12SemipropernessWitness}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}semiproperness\\text{-}witness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12SemipropernessWitness}_S(q,p,M,P,\\leq_P,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow p\\in P\\cap M\\land q\\leq_P p\\land\\exists W\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10SemiGenericCondition}_S(q,M,W,\\theta,P,\\leq_P)","display":true},{"tex":"q\\leq_Pp","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"M\\cap\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false}],"bytes":1503,"backlinks":[